  "goodToKnow": "Das Gitter is a grille, bars or a grid: das Fenstergitter, das Gitterbett (a cot with bars), das Gitternetz (grid). Hinter Gittern sitzen means to be behind bars, in prison, and hinter schwedischen Gardinen (behind Swedish curtains) is a joking synonym. Der Gitterzaun is a mesh fence. The plural is the same: die Gitter, and in the dative den Gittern. Neuter."
